From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aryz <aryz0713@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:51:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/11] library: install and update skills published by a
 website

Discover the file-list well-known index from a pasted website address or skills CLI command, retain all listed files and the website source, and use content hashes for updates. Keep website source links and update controls available in the Library. Downloads validate paths and resource limits before installation.

Validation so far: the original regression fails on the baseline at the website being treated as a git repository (fork Actions run 43210248824, attempt 1). The browser regression passes 22 tests across Chromium, WebKit, five languages and two widths. The fork workflow exercises the Go integration next; final verification will be recorded before the upstream submission.
